# Glowcap Lantern: the equipped Ornithopter explores a nonland card (CR 701.44a) and Bot1 accepts the graveyard: the Lightning
# Bolt goes to the graveyard, the Ornithopter is a 1/3 with its counter, and the Island below it is the next top card (never
# revealed, not in the hand).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Glowcap Lantern
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glowcap Lantern.Cast
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Glowcap Lantern.Activate(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = true
? Bot2.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept

